          <!-- At a glance -->
          <div class="art-glance">
            <h2 class="art-glance__title">At a glance</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>Most businesses already hold the customer information they need. It just sits in separate places.</li>
              <li>A phone system linked to a CRM can show who is calling, record the conversation and track follow-ups.</li>
              <li>AI can summarise calls and flag actions, but a person should always review the result.</li>
              <li>Australian rules apply to call recording, privacy and, from 10 December 2026, automated decision-making.</li>
